    {
      "id": 3419,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "An erroneous conditional comment for Internet Explorer browsers lower than version 9 was causing an attempted load of an insecure, non-existent JavaScript file over certain HTTPS requests from www.lyst.com. Although the targetted browser sessions were very low in number the request could still technically be hijacked. The comment has now been removed and the page no longer serves this request.",
